-## 4. Verdict
-
-The visual layout, spatial rhythm, interaction models, write-only secret ergonomics, and responsive behaviors implemented in `KANBA-134` (`KB-P3-36`) fully comply with all specification requirements.
-
-**Verdict: APPROVED**
