-| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
-| **Flagged-Link Audit Snapshots (`🕸️⚠️`)** | S12.3 6 invalidity classes with endpoint snapshots | Clean snapshot records (`source_id`, `target_id`, `link_type`, `detected_at`) | PASS |
